92_337638963599190306_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FUb8FXSm1vgQ7kNvwEN63iR&_nc_oc=AdlmB6aLu-umX0D2p1BP13rBwfrc6jZWkA6oZuotC7LMwrDQnvRQkCTO7yMLOVjzmf8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfstfxPAwVuz-y7j9G-G0OfhqPEi3WlSuYv5jeVo547DTg&oe=69A039F4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440 (2).png", "id": "1300838367963911", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974838_1300838371297244_1125909428722011491_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eUcMZHqNvhUQ7kNvwFXvRrO&_nc_oc=AdkAqOI305hPsSj0iwZIJ__uowG515tuCZQ2PEdSYgN323fLfRED4t_fUQv5vRxeAkI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsxS1w2aFay-Vf5feqh2H3VhzA6eMUsKA0AubWiQD03YQ&oe=69A04BCA"}, "display_name": "Interaction World Cube", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Cube control: Players can grab, move, rotate, and arrange cube blocks in 3D space, creating countless creative possibilities.\nFree movement: Explore the virtual world by moving freely in space, allowing players to approach every angle of the environment.\nDiverse worlds: Each world in the application has its own theme and challenges, ranging from simple to complex environments.\nEnvironmental interaction: Cube blocks can interact with elements in the environment, creating interesting effects and outcomes.\nIn-app purchases (IAP): Players can unlock additional new worlds through the in-app purchase system, expanding their gaming experience and exploration.\nVivid graphics: Sharp 3D images and bright colors create an engaging and vibrant VR world.", "short_description": "Interaction World Cube is an innovative and interactive virtual reality (VR) application designed to provide a unique experience for VR headset users. In this virtual world, players explore and interact with the environment by controlling various cube blocks."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://doc-hosting.flycricket.io/interaction-world-cu